# Note what is deliberately NOT ignored: data/prices-*.yaml and
# tests/golden/. The price file is the repository's evidence — it is dated,
# sourced and committed so that a number in the README can be traced to the page
# it came from. The golden file is the CLI's contract; regenerating it silently
# would defeat the test that guards it.
